[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/28.tres]生平考证[/font][/b]


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]仕历[/font][/b]


韩玄的正史记载极为稀少，《三国志》中仅有两处直接提及：

[color=#000000]一、《三国志·蜀书·先主传》[/color]


[indent][color=#666666]┃ 以琦为荆州刺史，南征四郡，武陵太守[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "金旋", "cat": "people"}]金旋[/url][/color]、长沙太守韩玄、桂阳太守[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "赵范", "cat": "people"}]赵范[/url][/color]、零陵太守[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "刘度", "cat": "people"}]刘度[/url][/color]皆降。[/color][/indent]


[color=#000000]二、《三国志·蜀书·关张马黄赵传·[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "黄忠", "cat": "people"}]黄忠[/url][/color]传》[/color]


[indent][color=#666666]┃ 荆州牧[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "刘表", "cat": "people"}]刘表[/url][/color]以（黄忠）为中郎将，与表从子磐共守长沙攸县。及曹公克荆州，假行裨将军，仍就故任，[color=#000000]统属长沙太守韩玄[/color]。[/color][/indent]


综合两处记载可知：

[indent]•  208年[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "曹操", "cat": "people"}]曹操[/url][/color]克荆州后，韩玄被任命（或留任）为长沙太守，黄忠作为武将受其节制[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  208年[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "刘备", "cat": "people"}]刘备[/url][/color]南征荆南四郡，韩玄望风而降，是四太守之一[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  降后结局：正史无明文，韩玄或继续担任长沙太守受蜀汉管辖，或离职，均无记载[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


